      "extracellular": false,
      "functional_impact_measured": "Western blot confirms FLAG-CLCA4 protein expression; colony formation assay shows ectopic CLCA4 inhibits MCF7 proliferation, indicating the tagged protein retains tumour-suppressor function. Surface localisation of the tagged construct was NOT MEASURED explicitly.",
      "gene_symbol": "CLCA4",
